{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Soraminen 是為 3 歲以上幼兒而設的日語學習 App，把平假名、片假名與數字的筆順練習化成從天空到太空的趣味旅程，適合想陪孩子一起接觸日語的家庭。程式為一次購買，沒有廣告與內購，亦無需註冊帳戶。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>筆順練習結合日語發音</h2>\n<p>小朋友可沿筆畫描寫平假名、片假名、0 至 99 數字及英文大小寫字母，跟隨示範掌握筆順，彩色軌跡與音效增添趣味，完成後自動接續下一字。程式亦提供日語發音示範與可選的裝置端語音辨識練習，未開放麥克風權限仍可描寫。學習期間可收集 150 張不重複的天氣與太空卡。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2778x1284bb-2-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2778x1284bb-3-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2778x1284bb-4-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2778x1284bb-5-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2778x1284bb-6-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2778x1284bb-7-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Soraminen: Japanese &amp; Numbers</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T11:38:09.802753+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":327,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-11T11:25:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T12:57:39.423314+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"e47348172bc40138ec64c3525a3b40e3c80a91f927cd19e24dec4bfd6d5c1021","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}